#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "During this lesson, we'll explore some variational algorithm examples and how to apply them:\n"
msgstr "Dans cette leçon, nous allons explorer quelques exemples d'algorithmes variationnels et la façon de les appliquer :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to write a custom variational algorithm\n"
msgstr "Comment écrire un algorithme variationnel personnalisé\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to apply a variational algorithm to find minimum eigenvalues\n"
msgstr "Comment appliquer un algorithme variationnel pour trouver les valeurs propres minimales\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to utilize variational algorithms to solve application use cases\n"
msgstr "Comment utiliser les algorithmes variationnels pour résoudre des cas d'usage applicatifs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the Qiskit patterns framework can be applied to all the problems we introduce here. However, to avoid repetition, we will only explicitly call out the framework steps in one example case, run on real hardware.\n"
msgstr "Le cadre des patterns Qiskit peut être appliqué à tous les problèmes présentés ici. Cependant, afin d'éviter les répétitions, nous ne mentionnerons explicitement les étapes du cadre que dans un seul exemple, exécuté sur du matériel réel.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problem definitions {#problem-definitions}"
msgstr "Définitions des problèmes {#problem-definitions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Imagine that we want to use a variational algorithm to find the eigenvalue of the following observable:\n"
msgstr "Imaginons que nous souhaitons utiliser un algorithme variationnel pour trouver la valeur propre de l'observable suivante :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{O}_1 = 2 II - 2 XX + 3 YY - 3 ZZ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{O}_1 = 2 II - 2 XX + 3 YY - 3 ZZ,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This observable has the following eigenvalues:\n"
msgstr "Cet observable a les valeurs propres suivantes :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"\\lambda_0 = -6 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_1 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_2 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_3 = 6\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"\\lambda_0 = -6 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_1 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_2 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_3 = 6\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: msgid repeated on page, first translation kept
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "And eigenstates:\n"
msgstr "Et les états propres suivants :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"|\\phi_0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_2\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle - |10\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_3\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle + |10\\rangle)\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"|\\phi_0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_2\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle - |10\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_3\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle + |10\\rangle)\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
